title: With the panel of a bar on in the layout menu, an extension's view opens inside the panel beside the bar its icon is on, follows its icon to the other bar and the bars to the other side, floats again when that panel is off, and its page is never loaded again
folders: rust-small
extensions: webview-extension, views-extension
prefs: {"dock_right": true}
limit: 150
forbid-log: WARN.*script
expect-log: script: tree qa\.items: > Fruits / v Vegetables /   carrot /   leek / Read me
expect-file: rust-small/qa-pages.txt :: chat holds 6 clicks and "kept across moves" after 1 load\(s\)
expect-file: ..\data\prefs.json :: "other_panel": true
expect-file: ..\data\prefs.json :: "dock_right": false
expect-file: ..\data\session.json :: "beside": "view:qa\.chat"

wait 3000
right qa.chat
wait 2500
page window.qa.more()
page window.qa.write('kept across moves')
wait 400
mark a-chat-floats-while-the-left-panel-is-off
wait 400
ui click 1545 20
wait 700
mark b-layout-menu
wait 400
ui click 1500 197
wait 1200
mark c-chat-in-the-left-panel-under-the-menu
wait 400
press escape
wait 600
page window.qa.more()
wait 400
mark d-chat-in-the-left-panel
wait 400
move qa.chat left
wait 1500
mark e-chat-follows-its-icon-to-the-right
wait 400
page window.qa.more()
ui drag 1680 206 26 260
wait 1500
mark f-dragged-back-to-the-left-bar
wait 400
ui click 26 242
wait 900
mark g-hidden-by-its-icon
wait 400
ui click 26 242
wait 1200
page window.qa.more()
wait 400
mark h-shown-again-by-its-icon
wait 400
ui drag 448 400 640 400
wait 900
mark i-panel-wider
wait 400
ui click 1545 20
wait 700
ui click 1500 256
wait 1500
mark j-sides-swapped-under-the-menu
wait 400
ui click 1500 226
wait 1500
mark k-right-panel-off-the-chat-floats
wait 400
press escape
wait 600
page window.qa.more()
right qa.fake-views
wait 2000
mark l-the-tree-floats-too
wait 400
ui click 1545 20
wait 700
ui click 1500 226
wait 900
press escape
wait 1500
mark m-right-panel-on-again
wait 400
right qa.fake-views
wait 2500
tree report
mark n-the-tree-in-the-right-panel
wait 400
right qa.chat
wait 1500
page window.qa.more()
wait 400
page window.qa.report()
wait 1200
mark o-chat-again
wait 400
quit

=== again
wait 5000
mark p-after-a-restart-the-chat-is-in-its-panel
wait 500
quit
